workstreams.mechanism:
drawnMetrics(L) defines, in the module header:
- markers drawn (member far-end marks plus one per root or far run);
- lineEnds (distinct port points at elements);
- ink (union length of drawn segments, each run once);
- visualCrossings (distinct proper intersection points between different drawn groups, a trunk counted once, pairs sharing an end element excluded as today);
- touches (T-contacts between groups);
- words, joins, bends, and shortSegs (interior segments under 8 px);
- foreignShared (sharedRuns over pairs not in one valid bundle);
- foreignOnTrunk (a non-member segment collinear with a run of 2 or more members for more than 6 px);
- foreignAtJoin (a non-member segment within 3 px of a join);
- tContacts (a non-member vertex within 0.5 px of a run of 2 or more members);
- tabStops (= L.edges.length);
- fallback and dissolved.

bundleIntegrity(L) returns a list of violations:
- members disagree on kind, label, ends, weak, reply, change, or the qualifier rule;
- members do not share the named node and face;
- runs do not form a tree rooted at the port with nested member sets;
- a split has no join, or a join is not at a split;
- a member's pts differ from its runs plus its branch;
- a member passes through an element;
- the root is shorter than 10 px (except for 'both');
- branches rejoin after parting;
- any foreignOnTrunk, foreignAtJoin or tContacts;
- a 4-way split in an undotted bundle;
- an excluded kind, arrangement or scene appears.

diagramMetrics.sharedRuns exempts a pair only when a.e.bundle===b.e.bundle and that bundle has no integrity violation. The comment cites audit/round2/03_DIAGRAMS.md:59 and :88 and the owner decision.

With no L.bundles every output equals today's. The generator writes audit/round10/evidence/notation-lines.json and .csv: per picture, control (consolidate:false) against after, bundles, joins, duplicates, dissolved, fallback and why, with group totals as in r10/exp-src/analyze.py (A reference defaults, B bank defaults, C reference Layers, D Grouped alternatives, E stress+scale routed, F straight). Timings go to a separate timing file, so the hashed body is deterministic.

workstreams.scope:
Every routed picture, through the one notationLayout entry point. Excluded:
- the sequence and lanes arrangements and scene 'process' (BPMN), for both fans and duplicates;
- straight, large and direct pictures, including radial straight lines;
- step, cardinality and crossing-marked edges, and self edges;
- fans of ArchiMate Flow or Triggering kinds, or families flow, sequence, message and path;
- fan-outs whose representative carries a qualifier.
The Running board is covered automatically: its 28 serves bundle at the component end.

